{"title":"1955 AHSME Problems/Problem 37","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1955_AHSME_Problems/Problem_37&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A three-digit number has, from left to right, the digits <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/a/c0a1e3f25571a09b6522d46832a274cee4444728.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$h, t$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"24\" height=\"16\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/d/9ad99798ec4c38e165cf517cb9e02b1c9e824103.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$u$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />, with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/5/4e561570b62ebed936bb4b036204af11881d5bd5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$h&gt;u$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"44\" height=\"13\" />. When the number with the digits reversed is subtracted from the original number, the units' digit in the difference is 4. The next two digits, from right to left, are:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/e/87e1ee7933bb0a4d1e33ee68b4f086cd326d882f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\text{5 and 9}\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ \\text{9 and 5}\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ \\text{impossible to tell}\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ \\text{5 and 4}\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ \\text{4 and 5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"645\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1955_AHSME_Problems/Problem_37&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can set up the subtraction like this:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/9/d59972e932ecda0e768a7850458db8a05513cf3d.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\text{ h t u}\\]\" width=\"35\" height=\"12\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/f/c0f73c09437d4954a4668a2c283cae747d77a207.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[- \\text{u t h}\\]\" width=\"48\" height=\"12\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/3/b/d3bc69feae8078965f4844aed4e8633f959a54cb.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[-------\\]\" width=\"120\" height=\"1\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/d/4fd1b41448a513fac8d46612623cab7e701dd498.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\text{? ? 4}\\]\" width=\"38\" height=\"12\" />\nSince <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/5/915262f955cd844cf071a2f79a067d13cde9d926.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$u &lt; h$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"44\" height=\"13\" />, we need to borrow the one from the tens column. Since the result of the tens column is 0, the taken 1 would result in the tens digit being 9:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/9/d59972e932ecda0e768a7850458db8a05513cf3d.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\text{ h t u}\\]\" width=\"35\" height=\"12\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/f/c0f73c09437d4954a4668a2c283cae747d77a207.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[- \\text{u t h}\\]\" width=\"48\" height=\"12\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/3/b/d3bc69feae8078965f4844aed4e8633f959a54cb.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[-------\\]\" width=\"120\" height=\"1\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/3/1/13105a273e404013f129ed34ba3117f9ae415bcd.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\text{? 9 4}\\]\" width=\"36\" height=\"12\" />\nWe can assign a value for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/d/9ad99798ec4c38e165cf517cb9e02b1c9e824103.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$u$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/8/8189a5b5a0917b8c93350827be4038af1839139d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$h$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" />, since that doesn't impact the difference, so lets say that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/b/a7b8a6176f4e2706395a890e6778628c92dbf0b3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$u=3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/d/ceddbd13cedeafd3d4b97f280c97bb86340b7fcc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$h=9$\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" />.\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/b/c5b1f691d9c4bd3ad35f08516310ac2930c2c306.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\text{ 9 t 3}\\]\" width=\"33\" height=\"12\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/1/891f46c7d52988b57fcdfb490181c9d68f5388a8.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[- \\text{3 t 9}\\]\" width=\"46\" height=\"12\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/3/b/d3bc69feae8078965f4844aed4e8633f959a54cb.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[-------\\]\" width=\"120\" height=\"1\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/3/1/13105a273e404013f129ed34ba3117f9ae415bcd.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\text{? 9 4}\\]\" width=\"36\" height=\"12\" />\nSince <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/8/4/584de03120c3cf9819a6a41f87be6ebdb9461dc8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t &lt; t+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"67\" height=\"13\" />, we can subtract one from the hundred's digit:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/b/c5b1f691d9c4bd3ad35f08516310ac2930c2c306.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\text{ 9 t 3}\\]\" width=\"33\" height=\"12\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/1/891f46c7d52988b57fcdfb490181c9d68f5388a8.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[- \\text{3 t 9}\\]\" width=\"46\" height=\"12\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/3/b/d3bc69feae8078965f4844aed4e8633f959a54cb.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[-------\\]\" width=\"120\" height=\"1\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/7/7870b4278f53a31f0ea85a7222ca13f01badb707.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\text{5 9 4}\\]\" width=\"35\" height=\"12\" />\nOut difference is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/6/7/f673f19c7384e66a5404d26b8dd80d007f8f2e95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$594$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"27\" height=\"13\" />. Therefore, the next two digits, from right to left, are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/2/ad26bf085468f248b6e5079c33034f9d7738a218.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B) } \\text{9 and 5}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"102\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1955_AHSME_Problems/Problem_37&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Go to the rest of the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1955_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1955 AHSME Problems\">1955 AHSME Problems</a>\n</p>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261016214051\nCache e